  "measurement": "Existing unmodified interpreter_gc and allocation instrumentation. Seven samples, 256 evaluations/sample, two warmup batches per cadence. Before timing then before allocation failure; after timing then after allocation, sequentially. Separate timing/instrumented builds. No CPU affinity or frequency control. Final after-runs occurred after verification and both builds finished; initial after-runs may overlap verification, are retained with -initial filenames, and are excluded.",
